# Build inputs and outputs of the Console SPA. Kept HERE rather than in the
# repo root, following the sibling Grafana plugin's convention: a component
# owns its own ignores, so moving or removing the component takes them with
# it.
#
# `package-lock.json` is deliberately NOT ignored -- it is the reproducible
# dependency set `npm ci` installs.
node_modules/
dist/

# Vite / npm scratch
.vite/
*.log
